# JOMOA Design System

## Core Principles
- **One surface scale**: deep-plum-black → warm-charcoal → surface-3
- **One accent color**: warm-terracotta (#D06A52)
- **One spacing scale**: 4px base unit (4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64)
- **One typography hierarchy**: Cormorant (H1) → Inter (H2-H6, body)
- **No visual exceptions**: All components must follow these rules

## Three-Level Hierarchy

### 1. Sections (Layout Level)
Large structural blocks that divide a page.

**Rules:**
- Separated by vertical spacing only (space-y-8 = 32px)
- NO borders between sections
- NO background color changes per section
- All sections use `bg-deep-plum-black` (page background)
- Sections define layout structure only

**Examples:**
- Hero area
- "Dagens fokus" section
- "Denna vecka" section
- Calendar area

**Spacing:**
- Section container: `space-y-8` (32px between sections)
- Section padding: `py-8` (32px top/bottom)

### 2. Cards (Content Containers)
Cards live INSIDE sections. They group related information.

**Rules:**
- ALL cards use `bg-warm-charcoal` (same surface level)
- Border radius: `rounded-card` (12px)
- Padding: `p-6` (24px) - consistent everywhere
- Border: `border border-border-soft` (subtle, consistent)
- NO strong white outlines
- NO inconsistent styling between cards
- Shadow: `shadow-soft` (minimal)

**Examples:**
- "Dagens fokus" card
- Weekly summary card
- Each day cell in calendar (if treated as cards)
- Status cards

**Card Variants:**
- Default: `bg-warm-charcoal border border-border-soft rounded-card p-6 shadow-soft`
- No hero/large variants - all cards are equal

### 3. Components (Building Blocks)
Reusable UI elements.

**Rules:**
- Must look identical everywhere
- All states defined: default, hover, active, focus, disabled
- NO hardcoded colors inside components
- Use design tokens only
- Minimum 44px tap targets
- Accessible contrast (AA)

**Component List:**
- Button (one system, all variants)
- Input (one system)
- Chip/Badge (one system)
- Progress bar (one system)
- Navigation item (one system)
- Icon + label (one system)

## Spacing Scale

Base unit: 4px

```
1 = 4px   (0.25rem)
2 = 8px   (0.5rem)
3 = 12px  (0.75rem)
4 = 16px  (1rem)
5 = 20px  (1.25rem)
6 = 24px  (1.5rem)
8 = 32px  (2rem)
10 = 40px (2.5rem)
12 = 48px (3rem)
16 = 64px (4rem)
```

**Usage:**
- Section spacing: `space-y-8` (32px)
- Card padding: `p-6` (24px)
- Component gaps: `gap-4` (16px)
- Text spacing: `mb-4` (16px between paragraphs)

## Typography Scale

**H1 (Page Title):**
- Font: `font-cormorant` (Cormorant)
- Size: `text-4xl` (36px)
- Weight: `font-semibold` (600)
- Line height: `leading-tight` (1.25)
- Color: `text-soft-light`

**H2 (Section Title):**
- Font: `font-inter`
- Size: `text-xl` (20px)
- Weight: `font-semibold` (600)
- Line height: `leading-tight` (1.25)
- Color: `text-soft-light`

**H3 (Card Title):**
- Font: `font-inter`
- Size: `text-base` (16px)
- Weight: `font-semibold` (600)
- Line height: `leading-normal` (1.35)
- Color: `text-soft-light`

**Body:**
- Font: `font-inter`
- Size: `text-base` (16px) - minimum for accessibility
- Weight: `font-normal` (400)
- Line height: `leading-normal` (1.35)
- Color: `text-soft-light`

**Small/Secondary:**
- Font: `font-inter`
- Size: `text-sm` (14px)
- Weight: `font-medium` (500)
- Line height: `leading-normal` (1.35)
- Color: `text-muted-warm`

## Color System

**Surfaces:**
- Page background: `bg-deep-plum-black` (#3A1F24)
- Cards/sections: `bg-warm-charcoal` (#4A262C)
- Inputs/hover: `bg-surface-3` (#5A2F36)

**Text:**
- Primary: `text-soft-light` (#F4EDE6)
- Secondary: `text-muted-warm` (#C6B8B2)

**Accent:**
- Primary: `bg-warm-terracotta` (#D06A52)
- Hover: `bg-accent-hover` (#E27B62)
- Pressed: `bg-accent-pressed` (#B95A45)

**Borders:**
- Soft: `border-border-soft` (rgba(244, 237, 230, 0.12))
- Strong: `border-border-strong` (rgba(244, 237, 230, 0.18))

## Component Specifications

### Button
- Height: `h-10` (40px) default, `h-8` (32px) sm, `h-12` (48px) lg
- Padding: `px-4 py-2` (16px horizontal, 8px vertical)
- Border radius: `rounded-button` (16px)
- States: default, hover, active, focus, disabled
- Focus ring: `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-warm-terracotta/50`

### Input
- Height: `h-10` (40px)
- Padding: `px-3 py-2` (12px horizontal, 8px vertical)
- Background: `bg-surface-3`
- Border: `border border-border-soft`
- Border radius: `rounded-card` (12px)
- Focus: `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-warm-terracotta/50`

### Chip/Badge
- Padding: `px-3 py-1` (12px horizontal, 4px vertical)
- Border radius: `rounded-full`
- Font: `text-xs` (12px)
- Weight: `font-medium` (500)

### Progress Bar
- Height: `h-3` (12px)
- Background: `bg-warm-charcoal`
- Fill: `bg-warm-terracotta` (or semantic colors)
- Border radius: `rounded-full`

## Navigation

**Sidebar/Topbar:**
- Background: `bg-warm-charcoal`
- Border: `border-border-soft`
- Active state: `bg-surface-3 text-warm-terracotta`
- Hover: `bg-surface-3`
- Stable position, no visual jumps

## Implementation Checklist

- [ ] 0 hardcoded colors (use tokens only)
- [ ] 0 random spacing (use scale only)
- [ ] 0 inconsistent components (one system)
- [ ] Only one accent color (warm-terracotta)
- [ ] Visual consistency across all screens
- [ ] Clear structural hierarchy (Sections → Cards → Components)
- [ ] Minimum 16px body text
- [ ] Minimum 44px tap targets
- [ ] Accessible contrast (AA)
- [ ] Clear hover, focus, selected states
